QUERY PLAN:text
Sort
  Output: i0.f1, ('123'::bigint), i1.f1, i2.q1, i2.q2
  Sort Key: i0.f1, ('123'::bigint)
  ->  Hash Right Join
        Output: i0.f1, ('123'::bigint), i1.f1, i2.q1, i2.q2
        Hash Cond: (i1.f1 = i0.f1)
        ->  Nested Loop Left Join
              Output: i1.f1, i2.q1, i2.q2, '123'::bigint
              ->  Seq Scan on public.a30_i4 i1
                    Output: i1.f1
              ->  Materialize
                    Output: i2.q1, i2.q2
                    ->  Seq Scan on public.a30_i8 i2
                          Output: i2.q1, i2.q2
                          Filter: (123 = i2.q2)
        ->  Hash
              Output: i0.f1
              ->  Seq Scan on public.a30_i4 i0
                    Output: i0.f1
